  m_text: "Privacy Policy\r\nLast Updated: 29/07/2025\r\n\r\nMaveria (\"we,\" \"our,\"
    or \"us\") operates the Block Rush mobile application (\"the Game\"). This Privacy
    Policy explains how we collect, use, and disclose personal data when you use
    our Game.\r\n\r\n1. INFORMATION COLLECTION AND USE\r\n\r\na) Automatically Collected
    Data:\r\nWe automatically collect your IP address to determine your approximate
    geographical location (such as country and city) using IP geolocation services.
    This data is used exclusively to provide regional leaderboards.\r\n\r\nb) User-Provided
    Data:\r\nIf you choose to set a player name, we store this name for display on
    the leaderboards.\r\n\r\nc) Third-Party Services and Data Usage:\r\n\r\n- Advertisements
    (Google AdMob):\r\n  We use Google AdMob to serve ads in the Game. AdMob may
    use cookies and collect device identifiers to provide personalized advertising.\r\n 
    More info: https://policies.google.com/privacy\r\n\r\n- Leaderboards (LootLocker):\r\n 
    We use LootLocker to manage online leaderboards. LootLocker collects player identifiers
    and scores.\r\n  More info: https://www.lootlocker.com/privacy-policy\r\n\r\nNote:
    We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of these third-party
    services.\r\n\r\n2. DATA SECURITY\r\nWe take commercially reasonable measures
    to protect your data. However, please note that no method of transmission over
    the Internet or method of electronic storage is completely secure.\r\n\r\n3.
    CONTACT US\r\nIf you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact
    us at:\r\ninfo@maveria.co\r\n"
